{
  "content": {
    "language": "en",
    "speaker": "",
    "lines": [
      {
        "line_id": "ln_001",
        "segment_id": "seg_001",
        "text": "Once upon a time, in a sunny meadow, lived a very fast Hare who loved to boast.",
        "pause_after_ms": 700
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_002",
        "segment_id": "seg_002",
        "text": "He often teased the slow, quiet Tortoise, who always took his time.",
        "pause_after_ms": 700
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_003",
        "segment_id": "seg_003",
        "text": "One day, the Hare challenged the Tortoise to a race to prove who was swifter.",
        "pause_after_ms": 700
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_004",
        "segment_id": "seg_004",
        "text": "The Tortoise, though doubtful, bravely agreed.",
        "pause_after_ms": 700
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_005",
        "segment_id": "seg_005",
        "text": "The race began! Zoom! The Hare dashed away, a blur of blue and white.",
        "pause_after_ms": 800
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_006",
        "segment_id": "seg_006",
        "text": "The Tortoise started slowly, one steady step after another.",
        "pause_after_ms": 700
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_007",
        "segment_id": "seg_007",
        "text": "Soon, the Hare was far, far ahead. He decided to take a little nap.",
        "pause_after_ms": 800
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_008",
        "segment_id": "seg_008",
        "text": "He snuggled under a big, leafy tree and quickly fell asleep.",
        "pause_after_ms": 700
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_009",
        "segment_id": "seg_009",
        "text": "Meanwhile, the Tortoise kept walking, slowly and without stopping.",
        "pause_after_ms": 700
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_010",
        "segment_id": "seg_010",
        "text": "Step by step, he came closer and closer to the sleeping Hare.",
        "pause_after_ms": 800
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_011",
        "segment_id": "seg_011",
        "text": "At last, the Hare woke up, stretched, and looked around.",
        "pause_after_ms": 700
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_012",
        "segment_id": "seg_012",
        "text": "He couldn't believe his eyes! The Tortoise was almost at the finish line!",
        "pause_after_ms": 800
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_013",
        "segment_id": "seg_013",
        "text": "The Hare zoomed off again, running as fast as he could.",
        "pause_after_ms": 700
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_014",
        "segment_id": "seg_014",
        "text": "But it was too late! The Tortoise crossed the finish line with a smile.",
        "pause_after_ms": 800
      },
      {
        "line_id": "ln_015",
        "segment_id": "seg_015",
        "text": "Everyone cheered for the Tortoise, who proved that slow and steady can win the race!",
        "pause_after_ms": 0
      }
    ],
