    "srt_text": "1\n00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,640\nOnce upon a time, in a sunny meadow, lived a very fast Hare who loved to boast.\n\n2\n00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:19,100\nHe often teased the slow, quiet Tortoise, who always took his time.\n\n3\n00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:28,240\nOne day, the Hare challenged the Tortoise to a race to prove who was swifter.\n\n4\n00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:34,340\nThe Tortoise, though doubtful, bravely agreed.\n\n5\n00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:43,920\nThe race began! Zoom! The Hare dashed away, a blur of blue and white.\n\n6\n00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:53,600\nThe Tortoise started slowly, one steady step after another.\n\n7\n00:00:54,300 --> 00:01:02,860\nSoon, the Hare was far, far ahead. He decided to take a little nap.\n\n8\n00:01:03,660 --> 00:01:11,220\nHe snuggled under a big, leafy tree and quickly fell asleep.\n\n9\n00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:20,080\nMeanwhile, the Tortoise kept walking, slowly and without stopping.\n\n10\n00:01:20,780 --> 00:01:29,500\nStep by step, he came closer and closer to the sleeping Hare.\n\n11\n00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:38,380\nAt last, the Hare woke up, stretched, and looked around.\n\n12\n00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:46,520\nHe couldn't believe his eyes! The Tortoise was almost at the finish line!\n\n13\n00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:53,400\nThe Hare zoomed off again, running as fast as he could.\n\n14\n00:01:54,100 --> 00:02:01,420\nBut it was too late! The Tortoise crossed the finish line with a smile.\n\n15\n00:02:02,220 --> 00:02:10,700\nEveryone cheered for the Tortoise, who proved that slow and steady can win the race!\n"
